[1mFeature combinations:[22m [38;5;10mtranslation/Cargo.toml[0m declares no [38;5;10m[features][0m section, and [38;5;10mc_src/CMakeLists.txt[0m has no conditional compilation or preprocessor options — a single [38;5;10madd_library(... SHARED src/lib.c)[0m. So the full enumeration is one configuration. [38;5;10mtranslation/verify_all_features.sh[0m derives this from Cargo.toml rather than hardcoding it, and covers [38;5;10m--no-default-features[0m, the default set, and both debug and release profiles. All pass [38;5;10mcargo check --all-targets[0m and [38;5;10mcargo test[0m.[0m[0m
