[1mDifferential tests[22m ([38;5;10mtests/differential.rs[0m, 13 tests) load both [38;5;10m.so[0m files with [38;5;10mlibloading[0m and compare [38;5;10mcrc16[0m results, working bottom-up through the C control flow: empty input across all 65536 seeds, the byte-at-a-time tail loop ([38;5;10mlen < 8[0m, table 0 only) with every byte value against every high seed byte, a single slice-by-8 block with each of the 8 positions swept across all 256 values to isolate every [38;5;10mtables[7-i][0m lookup, all 65536 seeds against one block, then every length 0–512, every multiple-of-8 boundary up to 4096, 64 start offsets, 20k randomized cases, buffers up to 3 MiB, and incremental chaining at nine chunk sizes. Table data was also compared numerically: all 2048 entries identical.[0m[0m
